      "content": "okay i tried tilting it a bit but i still hear this weird splashing/sloshing sound from way down in that base area even when it's not running. it almost feels like there's something stuck deep in the pan that the vacuum won't reach. why would water just stay stuck there like that? is it a suction issue or something?",
